UPDATE [dbo].[MATURITY_QUESTIONS] SET [Supplemental_Info]='<div><p><b>Question Intent:</b></p></div> To determine if the vulnerability information obtained from the established sources is kept current.  <ul> <li> Vulnerability data collection is a continuous process.</li> <li> The information from the sources (established in VM:G2.Q1) needs to be continually updated.</li> <li> New sources of vulnerability information must also be added to the source list as they emerge.</li> </ul>  <div><p><b>Criteria for “Yes” Response:</b></p></div> <ul> <li> The vulnerability information from all of the established sources is kept current.</li> </ul> <div><p><b>Criteria for “Incomplete” Response:</b></p></div> <ul> <li> The vulnerability information from some of the established sources is kept current.</li> </ul>' WHERE [Mat_Question_Id] = 3284
UPDATE [dbo].[MATURITY_QUESTIONS] SET [Supplemental_Info]='<div><p><b>Question Intent:</b></p></div> To determine if the vulnerability information obtained from the established sources is kept current.  <ul> <li> Vulnerability data collection is a continuous process.</li> <li> The information from the sources (established in VM:G2.Q1) needs to be continually updated.</li> <li> New sources of vulnerability information must also be added to the source list as they emerge.</li> </ul>  <div><p><b>Criteria for “Yes” Response:</b></p></div> <ul> <li> The vulnerability information from all of the established sources is kept current.</li> </ul> <div><p><b>Criteria for “Incomplete” Response:</b></p></div> <ul> <li> The vulnerability information from some of the established sources is kept current.</li> </ul>' WHERE [Mat_Question_Id] = 3285
